flowchart LR
    subgraph Admin["Control Plane (Next.js Dashboard + NestJS API :4000)"]
        UI["Dashboard (Toggle · Rules · Targets · Audit · Live Demo)"]
        API["NestJS API (FlagsService · Projects · AuditService · ADMIN_API_KEY)"]
        PG[("PostgreSQL + Prisma (Flag · FlagConfig · AuditLog · SdkKey)")]
        REDIS[("Redis Environment Dataset Cache")]
        PROM["Prometheus /metrics (kills · fetches · evaluations)"]
    end

    subgraph Edge["SDK Clients & Local Pure Engine (@flagship/sdk & frontend/lib/local-eval.ts)"]
        SDK["JS SDK Client (non-overlapping interval poll + in-memory cache)"]
        ENG["Pure Synchronous Engine (prereq -> kill switch -> target -> rule -> rollout)"]
        HASH["60-bit SHA-1 Bucketing: sha1(key.salt.bucketBy) / 0xFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF"]
    end

    UI -->|POST /flags, /toggle + x-actor-email| API
    API -->|write FlagConfig + AuditLog| PG
    API -->|DatasetService.refresh| REDIS
    API --> PROM
    SDK -->|GET /sdk/dataset (x-api-key: sdkKey)| API
    API -->|cache hit / rebuild| REDIS
    SDK --> ENG
    ENG --> HASH
